---
description: Keep every button label and icon on a single line
globs: web/src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Buttons never wrap

- Button content must never wrap onto multiple lines.
- Give buttons with text `whitespace-nowrap`; add `shrink-0` when they sit in a constrained flex layout.
- Keep icon-and-label buttons aligned with `flex items-center`.
- Do not hide wrapping by clipping text. Adjust the surrounding responsive layout if the button does not fit.
